      publication: { status: "PROVEN", evidence: "P197-A (2026-08-24): /ufc is one coherent current-card surface whose every claim derives from an artifact. The heading derives from the card's own startUtc (a fought card can never read as next); freshness is the card artifact's generatedAt, never a build time; a nearer card the model cannot read is NAMED with its real counts rather than skipped; the record region leads with the current era (fight model vs de-vigged price) and keeps the retired moneyline card behind a labelled archive disclosure with the eras-never-share-a-metric boundary stated (P196-C, guards pinned); per-bout reads with model version and unmodelled reasons render on the card; the graded record publishes on /results/picks/ufc with the market's answer beside every pick." },
